  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am trying to find information about the blend shapes / shape keys / pose morph / etc. necessary for avatar animation in VRC and I wasn't able to find anything in the official documentation about\nvrc.blink_left\nvrc.blink_right\nvrc.lowerlid_left\nvrc.lowerlid_right\nFrom what I have gathered searching online, I found that the order of these blend shapes is crucial (in this order and these must be the first 4 in the list) regardless of the names given to those blend shapes. This is in reference to VRCSDK 2, and I'm aware that some of this has changed in VRCSDK 3 (i.e. the number and order might be different), but it has been difficult to find official documentation about how to program the non-viseme (e.g. eye \"tracking\" or blinking) blend shapes for VRC at any rate.\nI had to ask around and search a lot before I was able to find the information I needed about this specific behavior, and I would like to see documentation added for this because I think that it could prevent some confusion.",
